  <prompt>Write the section renderers the record template needs for all six types (Information, Documents, Invoices, Files, Messages, Tasks &amp; events, Preview), wire the Document "Download" and Service Request "Delete request" toolbar actions, switch every opener to `RecordTemplateModal`, and delete the R3 stacked modal path with its tests ported.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in React, Fluent UI v9 and safe UI migrations. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>
  <goal>Every SPA path that opened `RecordDetailModal` (RecordOpener, GridWidgetBody, deep links, the notification bell, intake success links) opens `RecordTemplateModal` with each type's FR-01 sections; `RecordDetailModal.tsx` is deleted; the R3 behaviour its tests protected is protected by ported tests against the template; vitest, typecheck and lint pass.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Spec FR-01 (layout table; "the R3 stacked modal code path is removed"); plan Risk R4 ("port before retiring"). Behaviour to keep exactly in P1: fields (`RecordDetailFields`), documents (`DocumentLibrary` with `uploadOverride`), invoices list (`INVOICE_COLUMNS`), messages (`RecordMessages` with the send hold), events/to-dos (EventsCalendar + SmartTodo — still with R3's ViewOnly props; task 006 removes them), document download (`DocumentDownload`, `hasFile === false` hides it), service request delete/recall (`ServiceRequestActions`). P1 interim: the Invoice "Files" section renders R3's invoice `DocumentLibrary` (task 021 replaces it with ebilling's Files routes); the Document "Preview" section renders R3's file block (task 022 adds the inline preview).</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="new">src/client/external-spa/src/components/record/sections/InformationSection.tsx</file>
      <file role="new">src/client/external-spa/src/components/record/sections/DocumentsSection.tsx</file>
