  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + rigor declaration">Load the knowledge files, read the relevant files, declare rigor and model tier per task-execute Step 0.5.</step>
    <step order="1">Inventory every assertion in the eleven test files that reference `RecordDetailModal` or `record-detail-*` test ids; list them in the task notes with their target (port / keep / obsolete + reason).</step>
    <step order="2">Move each R3 section into `components/record/sections/*` and register it by section id; complete `recordTemplates.ts` section lists.</step>
    <step order="3">Wire Download (Document) and Delete request (Service Request) as toolbar actions; adapt `ServiceRequestActions.tsx` so its delete/recall flow can be started from the toolbar while keeping its dialogs, texts and 409 `has_related_records` recall path.</step>
    <step order="4">Switch `RecordOpener.tsx` (:16) and `GridWidgetBody.tsx` (:49) to `RecordTemplateModal`; keep the public `useOpenRecord` / `OpenRecordOptions` API unchanged.</step>
    <step order="5">Port the tests to the template (keep the `record-detail-*` test ids where tests and E2E rely on them, or update both), add `tests/RecordTemplateSections.test.tsx` for per-type section placement, then delete `RecordDetailModal.tsx` and `tests/RecordDetailModal.test.tsx`.</step>
    <step order="6">Grep `src/client/external-spa` for `RecordDetailModal`; only historical comments may remain, and they are reworded.</step>
    <step order="7">Run `npm run typecheck`, `npm run lint` and `npm test` in `src/client/external-spa`.</step>
    <step order="8">Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md`: set this task's status cell to `✅ [done]` and this POML's &lt;status&gt; to completed; run `pwsh scripts/check-task-status-drift.ps1`.</step>
    <step order="9">Record deviations and decisions in `projects/spaarke-SPA-external-access-platform-r4/notes/task-005-notes.md`.</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
    <trigger>If a ported R3 test cannot pass against the template without changing user-visible behaviour, STOP and escalate with the assertion and the proposed change; do not weaken the assertion.</trigger>
    <trigger>If any code outside `src/client/external-spa` imports `RecordDetailModal`, STOP before deleting it.</trigger>
  </escalation>

  <justification>
    <existing>The sections already exist inside `RecordDetailModal.tsx` (:367-528) and as SPA components (`DocumentLibrary`, `RecordMessages`, `EventsCalendar`, `SmartTodo`, `ServiceRequestActions`, `RecordDetailFields`).</existing>
    <extension>Yes, and this task does it: the section files are the existing code moved behind section ids; no new data path or component logic is introduced.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>The template from task 003 renders no content, and two record-detail code paths stay live, which FR-01 forbids ("the R3 stacked modal code path is removed").</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>

  <ui-tests>
    <test name="Each type opens in the template">
      <url>{spa-dev-url}/?record={token}:{id}</url>
      <steps><step>Open one record of each of the six types from its grid and from a deep link.</step><step>Compare columns and toolbar with the FR-01 table.</step><step>Check the console.</step></steps>
      <expected>Each type shows its FR-01 sections in the right column; Document shows no right column; no console errors.</expected>
    </test>
    <test name="R3 behaviours kept">
      <steps><step>Post a message and try to page away while it sends.</step><step>Download a document; open a document with no file.</step><step>As the requester, delete a service request with related records.</step></steps>
      <expected>Paging and Close are held during the send; Download works and is absent when there is no file; the 409 offers "Send recall request" as in R3.</expected>
    </test>
    <test name="Dark Mode (ADR-021)">
      <steps><step>Repeat the first test in dark theme and in the Teams host.</step></steps>
      <expected>Every section uses semantic tokens; no white panels.</expected>
    </test>
  </ui-tests>

  <tools>
    <tool name="npm">typecheck, lint and vitest in src/client/external-spa</tool>
    <tool name="terminal">Run shell commands</tool>
  </tools>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">src/client/external-spa/src/components/record/sections/</output>
    <output type="code">src/client/external-spa/src/components/record/RecordTemplateModal.tsx</output>
    <output type="code">src/client/external-spa/src/components/detail/RecordOpener.tsx</output>
